{"seq":3,"slug":"mha-mqa-gqa","title":"MHA / MQA / GQA 谱系：一条连续的取舍轴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/grouped-query-attention/foundations/mha-mqa-gqa","wordCount":1534,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"mha-mqa-gqa-谱系-一条连续的取舍轴\">MHA / MQA / GQA 谱系：一条连续的取舍轴</h1><p>把多头、多查询、分组查询三种注意力当成三个孤立发明去记，是最费劲也最容易记混的方式。它们其实是同一条轴上的三个点，轴的横坐标只有一个量：有多少份独立的 K/V。理解了这条轴，你不仅能一眼看懂任意模型的注意力配置，还能理解为什么 DeepSeek 的 MLA 是这条轴之外的另一个方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-kv-头数是唯一的自由度\">核心概念：KV 头数是唯一的自由度</h2><p>标准多头注意力（MHA）为每个查询头都配一份独立的键投影和值投影。设查询头数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 KV 头数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv} = n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每个头「独享」自己观察历史的方式。多查询注意力（MQA）走到另一个极端：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，所有查询头共享唯一一份 K/V。分组查询注意力（GQA）是介于两者之间的连续插值：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个查询头分成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 组，每组共享一份 K/V，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}=G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\le G \\le n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[8 个查询头] --&gt; B[MHA: 8 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;每头独享]&#10;  A --&gt; C[GQA G=4: 4 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;每 2 头共享]&#10;  A --&gt; D[GQA G=2: 2 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;每 4 头共享]&#10;  A --&gt; E[MQA: 1 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;全部共享]&#10;  B --&gt; F[质量最高 缓存最大]&#10;  C --&gt; G[质量≈MHA 缓存中]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; H[质量略降 缓存最小]\">flowchart TD\n  A[8 个查询头] --&gt; B[MHA: 8 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;每头独享]\n  A --&gt; C[GQA G=4: 4 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;每 2 头共享]\n  A --&gt; D[GQA G=2: 2 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;每 4 头共享]\n  A --&gt; E[MQA: 1 份 KV&lt;br/&gt;全部共享]\n  B --&gt; F[质量最高 缓存最大]\n  C --&gt; G[质量≈MHA 缓存中]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; H[质量略降 缓存最小]</pre><p>于是三者是同一个式子的特例：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 MHA，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是 MQA，中间任意值是 GQA。这条统一视角是 Ainslie 等人 2023 论文的核心贡献之一——他们没有发明一个全新机制，而是指出 MHA 和 MQA 只是一根连续旋钮的两端，中间大有可为。查询头如何被具体划分进这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 组，见 <a href=\"../mechanism/head-grouping\">KV 头分组</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三者的取舍全景\">三者的取舍全景</h2><p>沿着这根轴从 MHA 走到 MQA，四个量单调变化：KV 缓存单调减小、解码带宽压力单调减小、参数量略减、建模质量单调（但缓慢地）下降。关键在于质量下降不是线性的——从 MHA 减到 G=8 时质量几乎不动，继续减到 G=1（MQA）才出现可测的掉点。这个「前半段近乎免费、后半段才付代价」的非线性，正是 GQA 存在的全部理由，其定量曲线见 <a href=\"../tradeoffs/quality-speed\">质量与速度权衡</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MHA</th>\n<th>GQA (G=8)</th>\n<th>MQA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>KV 头数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV 缓存</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>1/8（相对64头）</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>建模质量</td>\n<td>基准最高</td>\n<td>几乎等同 MHA</td>\n<td>有可测下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练稳定性</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>大模型上偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数量</td>\n<td>最多</td>\n<td>略少</td>\n<td>最少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型采用</td>\n<td>Llama 1、早期 GPT</td>\n<td>Llama 3、Mistral</td>\n<td>PaLM、Falcon</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MQA 之所以在大模型上失宠，除了质量掉点，还有训练不稳定：单一份 K/V 要同时服务所有查询头，梯度信号相互挤压，容易发散。GQA 保留多组 K/V 提供了缓冲，既拿到大部分缓存收益，又避开了 MQA 的训练风险——这是它成为默认选择的另一层原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mla-轴之外的第二方向\">MLA：轴之外的第二方向</h2><p>到 2026 年，谱系上出现了一个不在这根轴上的重要玩家：DeepSeek 的多头潜在注意力（MLA，Multi-head Latent Attention）。MHA/MQA/GQA 都是靠「减少存几份 K/V」来省缓存，而 MLA 换了思路——它保留多头，但把 K/V 联合压缩到一个低秩潜在向量里存储，用时再投影回来。换句话说，GQA 沿「份数」这个维度省，MLA 沿「每份的秩」这个维度省。</p>\n<p>据 DeepSeek-V2 论文报告，在相同的 KV 缓存预算下，MLA 的建模表现优于 GQA，代价是实现和服务都更复杂。2025 年出现的 TransMLA 等框架（arXiv:2502.07864）进一步证明，LLaMA-3、Qwen-2.5、Mistral、Gemma-2 等现成 GQA 模型可以等价转换成 MLA 模型。本 hub 聚焦 GQA 这条主流、简单、已被广泛验证的路线，MLA 只在此点到并在 <a href=\"../practice/gqa-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 中讨论选型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"如何读懂一个模型的配置\">如何读懂一个模型的配置</h2><p>有了这条轴，读任意模型的配置文件就变成填空题：找到 <code>num_attention_heads</code>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）和 <code>num_key_value_heads</code>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），两者相除就是组大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>。相等则是 MHA，后者为 1 则是 MQA，介于之间就是 GQA。例如 Llama 3.1 8B 是 32 和 8，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>；Llama 3 70B 是 64 和 8，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span>；Mistral 7B 是 32 和 8。这两个数字就是整个注意力效率故事的全部超参数。</p>\n<p>这份「填空题」可以直接写成几行代码，把配置里的两个数翻译成轴上的位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def position(num_attention_heads, num_key_value_heads):&#10;    if num_attention_heads == num_key_value_heads:&#10;        return &quot;MHA&quot;&#10;    if num_key_value_heads == 1:&#10;        return &quot;MQA&quot;&#10;    return f&quot;GQA g={num_attention_heads // num_key_value_heads}&quot;&#10;&#10;position(32, 32)  # MHA&#10;position(32, 8)   # GQA g=4（Llama 3.1 8B）&#10;position(32, 1)   # MQA\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num_attention_heads, num_key_value_heads):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_attention_heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_key_value_heads:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MHA\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_key_value_heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MQA\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GQA g=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_attention_heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">//</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_key_value_heads</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">position(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MHA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">position(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GQA g=4（Llama 3.1 8B）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">position(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MQA</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这也让跨模型比较有了统一语言。当你看到某个 2026 年的新模型，第一件事就是查这两个数：它落在轴的哪个位置，直接告诉你它在质量与推理成本之间站在哪一边。完整的真实数字盘点见 <a href=\"../practice/gqa-adoption\">主流模型采用</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>为什么要坚持用这条轴，而不是背三个名字。</strong> 名字会过时、会新增（MLA、以及未来的其他变体），但「多少份 K/V、每份多宽」这两个量始终是决定性变量。反过来，把三者当成三个独立发明的反模式很典型：你会记不住该在什么场景用哪个，也无法解释为什么某个模型从 MHA 换到 GQA 后质量几乎没变。轴的好处是它把「记忆」换成「推导」——只要记住 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 两个端点，中间的任何配置都能就地还原。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MHA、MQA、GQA 是同一根旋钮的三段：旋钮就是 KV 头数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{kv}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时为 MHA，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时为 MQA，中间为 GQA。</li>\n<li>沿轴质量下降是非线性的：MHA→G=8 几乎免费，G=8→MQA 才付代价，这是 GQA 的全部价值来源。</li>\n<li>MQA 在大模型上因质量掉点与训练不稳定失宠；GQA 的多组 K/V 提供缓冲，兼得收益与稳定。</li>\n<li>MLA 是轴外的第二方向：不减份数而压低秩，同缓存预算下表现更优但更复杂，可从 GQA 等价迁移。</li>\n<li>读配置只需看 <code>num_attention_heads</code> 与 <code>num_key_value_heads</code> 两个数，相除即组大小，定位模型在轴上的位置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../mechanism/head-grouping\">KV 头分组</a> 讲清查询头具体如何分组；<a href=\"../tradeoffs/quality-speed\">质量与速度权衡</a> 给出沿轴移动的定量曲线。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../efficient-attention-mechanisms/foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy\">高效注意力机制 · 高效注意力分类</a> 把 GQA 放进更大的高效注意力谱系；<a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/compression/gqa-mqa-cache\">KV 缓存优化 · GQA/MQA 与缓存</a> 从缓存管理视角复述这条轴。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MHA / MQA / GQA 谱系：一条连续的取舍轴","id":"mha-mqa-gqa-谱系-一条连续的取舍轴"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：KV 头数是唯一的自由度","id":"核心概念-kv-头数是唯一的自由度"},{"level":2,"text":"三者的取舍全景","id":"三者的取舍全景"},{"level":2,"text":"MLA：轴之外的第二方向","id":"mla-轴之外的第二方向"},{"level":2,"text":"如何读懂一个模型的配置","id":"如何读懂一个模型的配置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"KV 内存瓶颈：把缓存开销算到字节","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/grouped-query-attention/foundations/kv-bottleneck"},"next":{"title":"KV 头分组：查询头如何配对到共享的 K/V","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/grouped-query-attention/mechanism/head-grouping"}}